{"version":1,"content":"<p>SpaceX行政總裁埃隆·馬斯克表示，公司已完成一種可安裝在屋頂的微型蜂窩基站設計，能夠改善手機信號覆蓋，並解決星鏈衞星信號難以穿透建築物、尤其是金屬屋頂所造成的室內信號盲區。馬斯克在本周DealBook峯會接受採訪時稱，這類微型基站預計將在2027年投入生產。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587222.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.934313+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:15:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_hash":"96249e3600d126336e394b540aacc98a73305e59e17b337f956a1c97531e10ce","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}